% Hand-curated entries live here. Auto-resolved entries written by
% `quartobot resolve` land in references.json (regenerated each render,
% ignored by git).
%
% Two kinds of entry:
% - Keys without a prefix (e.g. allofus2019) are hand-curated entries
%   that quartobot never resolves.
% - Keys shaped like resolver keys (doi:, pmid:, url:, isbn:, ...)
%   deliberately override quartobot's output for the same key: an entry
%   here replaces the resolved one whole. This works because _quarto.yml
%   lists references.bib after references.json and pandoc takes the later
%   bibliography. `python3 ci/check_refs.py` lists every overridden key.

% Consortium-authored articles. Crossref lists the consortium as the
% author, but `quartobot resolve` drops consortium names, so these are
% cited by hand-curated keys instead of @doi:/@pmid:. Metadata from
% Crossref.

